#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. Mix = the game's own TAA blended with DLAA / DLSS: calmer, a bit softer. "
"off = the game's own picture. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = čisti robovi v velikosti upodabljanja igre. DLSS = isto, in poveča sliko, ko je "
"Prilagajanje velikosti igre pod 100 %. Mešanica = lasten TAA igre, pomešan z DLAA / DLSS: "
"mirneje, malo mehkeje. izklop = lastna slika igre. Shrani se takoj."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How much of the Mix is the game's TAA, 0 - 100 % in 10 % steps: more = calmer and softer, less = "
"sharper. Shown while Mode is Mix, or a split has a Mix side. No extra cost."
msgstr ""
"Koliko mešanice je TAA igre, 0 - 100 % v korakih po 10 %: več = mirneje in mehkeje, manj = "
"ostreje. Prikazano, dokler je Način Mešanica ali ima delitev stran z mešanico. Brez dodatnih "
"stroškov."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your graphics card. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, a lighter Glass "
"and fence fix, mirrors without Track moving parts. low = also no Smooth mirrors, no Glass and "
"fence fix, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Prednastavitve za vašo grafično kartico. visoka = vse vklopljeno (model 1). srednja = model 2, "
"lažji popravek stekel in ograj, ogledala brez sledenja gibljivim delom. nizka = tudi brez gladkih "
"ogledal, brez popravka stekel in ograj, območje VR 60 %. Nikoli ne spremeni nastavitve, ki ste jo "
"nastavili sami."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, fewest trails "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = največ podrobnosti, najostrejše besedilo, približno 1,6-krat več GPU kot 2. 2 (E) = "
"uravnotežen, najmanj sledi za prometom: začnite tu. 3 (F) = najmirnejši na ograjah in žicah, "
"lahko zamaže gibljive podrobnosti, enaka cena kot 2. 4 (M) = najzahtevnejši (približno 5-krat), "
"samo za teste v ravnem načinu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the Glass and fence fix, the Light trail fix and "
"the DLAA area. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kakovost slike: ostrenje, ostrina tekstur, popravek stekel in ograj, popravek sledi luči in "
"območje DLAA. Desno skupino odpre, levo zapre; ob vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Izostri sliko po DLAA, od 0 (izk.) do 1,0. Povečajte, če je slika mehka; preveč daje svetle "
"sijaje na robovih. Stane približno 0,1 ms; 0 preskoči ta prehod."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Kako daleč seže ostrenje, 1 do 4 px: majhno = fine podrobnosti, veliko = krepkejši robovi. "
"Spremenite, če je ostrenje preveč fino ali grobo; slika, večja od zaslona, kot v VR, potrebuje "
"več kot 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Ostrejše besedilo na teksturah (prometni znaki, armaturna plošča, GPS). 0 = izk.; bolj negativno "
"= ostreje, a ograje bolj utripajo; poskusite -0,5 do -1, če je besedilo zamegljeno. Skoraj nič ne "
"stane."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaves: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it if "
"grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Works only while Texture sharpness is not 0. "
"Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Isto za žičnate ograje, travo in listje: povečajte proti 0, če ograje utripajo, zmanjšajte, če "
"trava izgleda mehko. enako = sledi vrstici zgoraj. Deluje samo, ko Ostrina tekstur ni 0. Skoraj "
"nič ne stane."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Wires, fences and windows are treated as the thing in front, not as what you see through them, so "
"they do not smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms "
"per eye."
msgstr ""
"Žice, ograje in okna se obravnavajo kot tisto, kar je spredaj, ne kot tisto, kar vidite skozi "
"njih, zato se med premikanjem ne razmažejo. Izklopite, če tam ne vidite razmazanosti: prihrani "
"0,02 - 0,06 ms na oko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: the glows are "
"drawn fresh each frame instead of being blended with older frames. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp "
"glows flicker, 0 = off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Prepreči, da bi sij uličnih svetilk in avtomobilskih luči za seboj puščal sled, ko se premikate: "
"sij se v vsaki sličici nariše na novo namesto mešanja s starejšimi sličicami. Koraki po 25 %; "
"zmanjšajte, če sij utripa, 0 = izk. Stane približno 0,05 - 0,2 ms na oko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: DLAA dobi samo sredina vsakega očesa (20 do 100 %); rob obdrži sliko igre. Zmanjšajte za "
"težji model ali več sličic; 40 % stane približno 40 % modela. Nastavi tudi tovornjak v garaži / "
"glavnem meniju."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kako DLAA obravnava premične dele in ogledala tovornjaka. Desno skupino odpre, Levo jo zapre; ob "
"vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA follows each moving thing on its own (traffic, wheels, number plates), so it stays sharp and "
"leaves no trail. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: everything then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"DLAA vsako premikajočo se stvar spremlja posebej (promet, kolesa, registrske tablice), zato "
"ostane ostra in ne pušča sledi. Izklopite le za prihranek približno 0,5 ms na oko ali za test: "
"potem se vse premika s kamero in promet se razmaže."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Smooths the truck mirrors too, so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can leave "
"trails in the glass; the others follow each moving thing."
msgstr ""
"Zgladi tudi ogledala tovornjaka, da ne utripajo. 1 ogledalo = samo največje (glavno poleg vas). "
"vsa = vsako ogledalo. kamera = najcenejše na ogledalo, vozila v gibanju lahko pustijo sledi v "
"steklu; ostali načini sledijo vsaki premikajoči se stvari."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"vkl. = vsako ogledalo dobi DLAA vsako 2. sličico in vmes pokaže zadnjo čisto sliko: približno "
"polovica cene ogledal. Robovi ostanejo čisti; premikajoče se stvari v steklu se osvežujejo s "
"polovično hitrostjo. izk. = vsako ogledalo vsako sličico."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate and CPU: CPU tuning, AMD cache cores, an FPS cap and Low delay (Reflex) for flat, an "
"FPS cap for VR. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Hitrost sličic in CPU: nastavitev CPU, jedra z AMD predpomnilnikom, omejitev FPS in Nizka "
"zakasnitev (Reflex) za ravni način, omejitev FPS za VR. Desno skupino odpre, levo zapre; ob "
"vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together. Prefer fast cores: only Intel CPUs with P-cores and E-cores. Higher "
"priority and no Windows power saving for the game: every CPU, Intel and AMD. Helps when the CPU "
"is the limit; no cost. Separate in dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tri stikala CPU skupaj. Prednost hitrim jedrom: samo procesorji Intel z jedri P in E. Višja "
"prioriteta in brez varčevanja z energijo Windows za igro: vsak CPU, Intel in AMD. Pomaga, ko je "
"omejitev CPU; nič ne stane. Ločeno v dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D): keeps the game on the cores with the big 3D "
"V-Cache, which games like. Switches at once; off gives the game all cores back. Try it and "
"compare in a busy city. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Procesorji AMD X3D z dvema skupinama jeder (7950X3D, 9950X3D): igro drži na jedrih z velikim "
"predpomnilnikom 3D V-Cache, ki ga igre ljubijo. Preklopi takoj; izk. igri vrne vsa jedra. "
"Poskusite in primerjajte v prometnem mestu. Nič ne stane."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Low delay (Reflex) on, the NVIDIA "
"driver does the limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravni način. Igro drži največ pri tej hitrosti sličic: enakomeren čas sličice, manj toplote "
"in energije. Nastavite nekoliko pod tisto, kar vaš računalnik zdrži v prometnem mestu. Ko je "
"Nizka zakasnitev (Reflex) vklopljena, omejuje gonilnik NVIDIA. izk. = brez omejitve."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only (NVIDIA Reflex). On = the game's frames wait less before the graphics card "
"draws them: less delay between your steering and the picture when the card is the limit. Boost "
"also keeps the card's clocks up. Same fps; small cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravni način, samo NVIDIA (NVIDIA Reflex). Vkl. = sličice igre čakajo manj, preden jih "
"grafična kartica nariše: manjša zakasnitev med krmiljenjem in sliko, ko je omejitev kartica. "
"Boost dodatno drži visoke takte kartice. Enak FPS; majhna cena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills in the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it "
"when the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. polovica = igra nariše vsako 2. sličico očal (72 Hz -> 36 fps), tretjina = vsako 3.; "
"glajenje sličic očal (ASW / Motion Smoothing) napolni ostalo v enakomernem ritmu. Uporabite, ko "
"FPS niha. Ko je vklopljeno, izklopi Turbo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering, skipping the hidden lens edges, and whether OFXR Bridge "
"/ VectorXR are found. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu "
"opens."
msgstr ""
"Pohitritve VR: Turbo, foveated rendering, preskok skritih robov leč in ali sta najdena OFXR "
"Bridge / VectorXR. Desno skupino odpre, levo zapre; ob vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo switches off the headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). VR only. On = "
"the game stops waiting for the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy "
"cities, traffic). Turn it off if the picture judders."
msgstr ""
"Turbo izklopi glajenje sličic očal (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). Samo VR. Vkl. = igra v vsaki "
"sličici ne čaka na očala: več FPS le, ko je omejitev CPU (prometna mesta, promet). Izklopite, če "
"slika trza."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring gets one colour per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Oster center, manj podrobnosti na robu (samo NVIDIA RTX). Prihrani čas GPU pri visokem "
"Skaliranju. Samo VR. Zunanji obroč dobi eno barvo na 2 x 2 piksla; ograje, trava in listje "
"ohranijo polne podrobnosti. Izklopite, če rob izgleda kockasto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated rendering is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the "
"view sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Kako velik je oster center Foveated rendering, 10 - 100 % v korakih po 5 %: večji = več slike "
"ostre, manj prihranka; manjši = več prihranka, manj podrobnosti se začne bližje sredini. Privzeto "
"je 80 % (uravnotežen); 90 = širok, 65 = ozek."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What Foveated rendering makes coarser. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + lighting = "
"also the game's lighting, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for blocky light or "
"shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Kaj Foveated rendering naredi bolj grobo. prizor = samo 3D svet (privzeto). prizor + osvetlitev = "
"tudi osvetlitev igre, samo na samem robu: več prihranka. Preizkusite: iščite kockaste robove luči "
"ali senc ob strani vidnega polja."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated rendering is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Kako grob je zunanji obroč Foveated rendering. Običajen = 1 barva na 2 x 2 piksla (privzeto). "
"Močan = na 4 x 2, Maks. = na 4 x 4: več prihranka GPU, bolj kockasti robovi. Najbolje s sledenjem "
"očem, kjer na zunanji obroč nikoli ne gledate."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated rendering follows your eyes on a headset with eye "
"tracking (for example Varjo); without it the centre stays in the middle of the lens. Needs "
"Foveated rendering on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Poskusno. Oster center Foveated rendering sledi vašim očem na očalih s sledenjem očem (na primer "
"Varjo); brez tega ostane center na sredini leče. Zahteva vklopljeno Foveated rendering ob zagonu "
"igre, sicer ponovni zagon. Skoraj nič ne stane."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Igra preskoči vogale leč, ki jih nikoli ne vidite (VR očala jih sporočijo), zato nariše "
"manj pikslov: več rezerve GPU, vidna slika ostane enaka. Prvi vklop zahteva ponovni zagon igre. "
"Izklopite, če rob pogleda izgleda narobe."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = generiranje sličic za VR od djules75, ločen prenos "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). najden = njegov sloj je naložen v tej igri in mod spusti "
"njegovo delo skozi. Zaženite njegovo aplikacijo v sistemski vrstici pred igro."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = nabor izboljšav OpenXR od DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, globina, "
"generiranje sličic; najden = njegov sloj je naložen v igri in mod spusti njegovo delo skozi. "
"Uporabljajte le en Turbo (njegov ali modov)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the game's own VR UI floats (HUD, menus). The mod types the change into the game's console "
"for you; needs g_developer and g_console 1 in config.cfg. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Kje lebdi igri lasten VR vmesnik (HUD, meniji). Mod vnese spremembo v konzolo igre namesto vas; "
"potrebuje g_developer in g_console 1 v config.cfg. Desno skupino odpre, Levo jo zapre."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's VR UI layouts the rows below move: driving (the HUD while driving) or menus "
"(the game's menu screens)."
msgstr ""
"Katero od postavitev VR vmesnika igre premikajo spodnje vrstice: vožnja (HUD med vožnjo) ali "
"meniji (zasloni menijev igre)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the game's VR UI: height, side, distance, tilt, turn, size or curve, in small steps. The "
"game gets each change about 0.4 s after your last press: the console opens and closes by itself."
msgstr ""
"Premika VR vmesnik igre: višino, stran, razdaljo, nagib, zasuk, velikost ali ukrivljenost, v "
"majhnih korakih. Igra prejme vsako spremembo približno 0,4 s po vašem zadnjem pritisku: konzola "
"se odpre in zapre sama."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Right: every value of both layouts back to what config.cfg had at the start (the game saves its "
"own values when it exits)."
msgstr ""
"Desno: vse vrednosti obeh postavitev se vrnejo na to, kar je imel config.cfg na začetku (igra ob "
"izhodu shrani svoje vrednosti)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR): fps, ms, "
"numbers only, each with or without a graph of recent frame times (spikes show red), or the graph "
"alone. Its GPU cost is measured. Save keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Majhno živo okno s FPS in časom sličice, tudi ko je meni zaprt (ravni način in VR): fps, ms, samo "
"številke, vsako z grafom zadnjih časov sličic (konice so rdeče) ali brez, ali samo graf. Njegova "
"cena GPU je izmerjena. Shranjevanje ga ohrani."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Zaklep, položaj, velikost, barva, razdalja v VR in obrat polja fps. Desno skupino odpre, Levo jo "
"zapre; ob vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Premakne polje fps vstran, v % zaslona (VR fiksno / pritrjeno: stopinje okoli vas). Ravni način "
"in VR imata vsak svoj položaj. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Premakne polje fps gor / dol, v % zaslona (VR fiksno / pritrjeno: stopinje, minus = gor). Ravni "
"način in VR imata vsak svoj položaj. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Polje fps poveča ali zmanjša (0,2 .. 3,0). Povečajte, če ga v VR očalih ali na velikem zaslonu ne "
"morete prebrati. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Barva besedila polja fps: 20 barv, vsaka z obrobo, da je berljiva na vsaki sliki (črna na beli = "
"temno besedilo, bela obroba). Ravni način in VR. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Svetlost polja fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = barva nespremenjena, nižje zatemni besedilo (obroba ostane) "
"proti črni. Uporabite za zatemnitev števca ponoči ali v VR očalih. Ravni način in VR. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kako neprosojno je celotno polje fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = polno, nižje bledi besedilo IN njegova "
"črna obroba skupaj, zato se zatemnjeno polje ne spremeni v črno packo. Ravni način in VR. Brez "
"cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far back the fps graph shows: 2 - 60 s. One bar per slice of time = its slowest frame, so you "
"see spikes. Green = on time, yellow = a bit slow, red = a hitch; the line = the headset rate / "
"FPS cap / your usual. Shown when FPS counter has a graph."
msgstr ""
"Kako daleč nazaj sega graf FPS: 2 - 60 s. En stolpec na časovni odsek = njegova najpočasnejša "
"sličica, zato vidite konice. Zelena = pravočasno, rumena = malo počasi, rdeča = zatikanje; črta = "
"hitrost očal / omejitev FPS / vaša običajna. Prikazano, ko ima Števec FPS graf."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + Track "
"moving parts). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Sledi glavi = premika se z očali. Fiksno v igralnem prostoru = ena točka okoli vašega "
"sedeža, ne upošteva zibanja kabine. Pritrjeno na vozilo = prilepljeno na kabino, ziblje se z njo "
"(potrebuje DLAA + Sledi gibljivim delom). Nič ne stane."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR, samo Pritrjeno na vozilo. vkl. = vsak tovornjak / avto ima lastno mesto polja fps v kabini, "
"obrat, velikost, barvo, svetlost in besedilo (shranjeno v dlaa.ini ob zaprtju menija). izk. = en "
"skupen nabor za vsa vozila. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"VR, samo Pritrjeno na vozilo. Desno = znova izmeri kabino zdaj (sedite pri miru, parkirani), če "
"polje ne stoji pravilno. Levo = polje tega vozila nazaj na privzeto (mesto, obrat, velikost, "
"barva, besedilo); druga vozila obdržijo svoje. Polje je pravokotno na kabino."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. Obrne polje fps levo / desno okoli lastne osi, v "
"stopinjah (+ = njegova sprednja stran se obrne v desno). Uporabite za nagib polja, ko je ob "
"strani. 0 = gleda proti vam. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. Nagne polje fps, v stopinjah (+ = njegov vrh se nagne "
"stran od vas, kot da leži na armaturni plošči). 0 = gleda proti vam. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. Zavrti polje fps v njegovi ravnini, v stopinjah (+ = v "
"smeri urnega kazalca). 0 = pokonci. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. Kako daleč lebdi polje fps, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Obdrži enako "
"velikost v pogledu pri vsaki razdalji; spremeni se le globina. Postavite ga blizu globine, na "
"katero gledate, da ga preberete brez ponovnega izostrenja. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Položaj, velikost, globina in obrat plošče ter tipke menija. Desno skupino odpre, Levo jo zapre; "
"ob vsakem odprtju menija je zaprta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Premakne ploščo vstran, v % zaslona (VR fiksno v kabini: stopinje okoli sedeža). Ravni način in "
"VR imata vsak svoj položaj. Uporabite, če plošča zakriva kaj, kar potrebujete. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Premakne ploščo gor / dol, v % zaslona (VR fiksno v kabini: stopinje, plus = dol). Ravni način in "
"VR imata vsak svoj položaj. Uporabite, če plošča zakriva kaj, kar potrebujete. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Ploščo poveča ali zmanjša. Povečajte, če je ne morete prebrati, zmanjšajte, če zakriva preveč. "
"Ravni način in VR imata vsak svojo velikost. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Sledi glavi = plošča se premika z VR očali. Fiksno v kabini = ostane na enem mestu pred "
"sedežem, stabilno ob razgledovanju; X / Y / globina nato nastavijo to mesto (stopinje, metri). "
"Zahteva sloj VR (privzeto). Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. Kako daleč lebdi plošča: v metrih (0,30 - 3,00) kot "
"sloj VR, privzeto; v px notranjega zamika na oko pri menu_vr_layer = 0. Enaka velikost pri vsaki "
"globini. Spremenite, če je gledanje plošče naporno. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, zato v ravnem načinu zasivljeno. vkl. = plošča se obrne proti vam, ko jo premaknete "
"vstran, enaka velikost pod vsakim kotom (kot sloj VR, privzeto, tudi polje fps, ki sledi glavi); "
"izk. = ravna slika. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches for comparing: DLAA off, the game's own TAA mixed in or side by side, the wire fixes, "
"running DLAA earlier. Nothing here is needed for normal driving. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it."
msgstr ""
"Stikala za primerjavo: DLAA izk., lasten TAA igre primešan ali ob strani, popravki žic, zgodnejši "
"zagon DLAA. Nič od tega ni potrebno za običajno vožnjo. Desno skupino odpre, levo zapre."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Vklopi ali izklopi celoten mod in si zapomni način; izk. pokaže sliko same igre, za primerjavo. "
"Izk. prihrani ceno vseh delov skupaj."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = the mod on the left, the game's own TAA on the right, to compare (Split line position, "
"Split: left | right). Replaces Mix while on. With the game's console on, the mod switches the "
"game's Anti-aliasing for you."
msgstr ""
"vklop = mod levo, lasten TAA igre desno, za primerjavo (Položaj ločilne črte, Delitev: levo | "
"desno). Dokler je vklopljeno, nadomesti Mešanico. Ko je konzola igre vklopljena, mod namesto vas "
"preklopi glajenje robov igre."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the split line is, 0 - 100 % of the width in 5 % steps: the mod's DLAA / DLSS on the left "
"of it, the game's TAA on the right. Used only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Kje je ločilna črta, 0 - 100 % širine v korakih po 5 %: levo od nje DLAA / DLSS moda, desno TAA "
"igre. Uporabljeno samo, dokler je Delitev s TAA igre vklopljena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What the split shows on its two sides: DLAA | TAA (the mod left, the game's TAA right), Mix | TAA "
"or DLAA | Mix (Mix = the two blended at Mix amount). DLSS instead of DLAA when upscaling. Used "
"only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Kaj delitev prikaže na obeh straneh: DLAA | TAA (mod levo, TAA igre desno), mešanica | TAA ali "
"DLAA | mešanica (mešanica = oboje pomešano po Količini mešanice). DLSS namesto DLAA pri povečavi. "
"Uporabljeno samo, dokler je Delitev s TAA igre vklopljena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires move correctly while you drive: their movement is spread over the whole thin line. on "
"= default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is soft for a moment when "
"you switch."
msgstr ""
"Tanke žice se med vožnjo pravilno premikajo: njihovo gibanje se razporedi po celotni tanki črti. "
"vkl. = privzeto. izk. = samo za primerjavo; bližnje žice bolj utripajo. Slika je ob preklopu za "
"trenutek mehka."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires count as in front on every pixel they touch, even where they cover only a sliver of "
"it. on = default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges such as leaves. off = only to compare; "
"near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Tanke žice štejejo kot spredaj na vsakem pikslu, ki se ga dotaknejo, tudi če ga pokrivajo le "
"delček. vkl. = privzeto. vkl. (brez A2C) = tudi za prosojne robove, na primer listje. izk. = samo "
"za primerjavo; bližnje žice bolj utripajo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Poskusno: oddaljene žice, tanjše od 1 piksla, nariše kot črto širine 1 piksla, da se ne trgajo v "
"črtice. Privzeto izk.: oddaljene žice lahko izgledajo temnejše ali bolj utripajo. Poskusite in "
"primerjajte."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA runs before the game adds its glow and colour look, so lane paint, wires and "
"rails shimmer less. Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscaling or Windows HDR. Same "
"cost either way; takes about a second to switch."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravni način: DLAA teče, preden igra doda sij in barvni videz, zato barva na cesti, žice in "
"tirnice manj utripajo. Spreminjajte samo za primerjavo. Ni v uporabi pri skaliranju DLSS ali "
"Windows HDR. Enaka cena; preklop traja približno sekundo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Bug report: press the capture key twice (or Capture now) where something looks wrong; the mod "
"writes one zip you attach to a GitHub issue. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Poročilo o napaki: dvakrat pritisnite tipko za zajem (ali Zajemi zdaj) tam, kjer nekaj izgleda "
"narobe; mod zapiše en zip, ki ga priložite zadevi na GitHubu. Desno skupino odpre, levo zapre."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"One switch for the most complete report: log detail debug, rewind 2 s, capture Full. Off puts the "
"rows back as they were. Only this switch is saved; the forced values are never written to "
"dlaa.ini."
msgstr ""
"Eno stikalo za najpopolnejše poročilo: podrobnost dnevnika debug, previjanje 2 s, zajem Polni. "
"Izk. vrne vrstice, kot so bile. Shrani se samo to stikalo; vsiljene vrednosti se nikoli ne "
"zapišejo v dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics and timing "
"measurements (a little slower)."
msgstr ""
"Kaj gre v dlaa_inject.log: izk. = nič; napake = samo odpovedi (privzeto); opozorila = + zaobidene "
"težave; info = + zagon in spremembe; razhroščevanje = + statistika in meritve časa (nekoliko "
"počasneje)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Keeps the last 0.5 - 3 s of frames on the graphics card all the time, so the report shows the "
"moment BEFORE the key (+ what DLSS got for the last frames). Costs graphics memory (the MB in the "
"cost column) and a picture copy per frame. off = none."
msgstr ""
"Ves čas drži zadnjih 0,5 - 3 s sličic na grafični kartici, zato poročilo pokaže trenutek PRED "
"tipko (+ kaj je DLSS dobil v zadnjih sličicah). Stane grafični pomnilnik (MB v stolpcu cene) in "
"kopijo slike na sličico. izk. = nič."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Quick = system info, logs, settings, your picture and DLAA off for a few frames (about 1 s). Full "
"= + what DLSS got per frame (colour, motion, depth) and A/B sets: motion view, motion off, jitter "
"only (about 2 - 4 s)."
msgstr ""
"Hiter = podatki o sistemu, dnevniki, nastavitve, vaša slika in DLAA izk. za nekaj sličic "
"(približno 1 s). Polni = + kaj je DLSS dobil na sličico (barva, gibanje, globina) in kompleti "
"A/B: pogled gibanja, gibanje izk., samo jitter (približno 2 - 4 s)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The capture key. Press it TWICE within 1 s while driving where it goes wrong (the first press "
"only arms it: one short beep). Right opens the Hotkeys page on its line to change it."
msgstr ""
"Tipka za zajem. Pritisnite jo DVAKRAT v 1 s med vožnjo tam, kjer gre kaj narobe (prvi pritisk jo "
"samo pripravi: en kratek pisk). Desno odpre stran Bližnjic na njeni vrstici, kjer jo spremenite."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How many captures stay in the dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL: older ones (folder + zip) are "
"deleted when a new one is written. all = never delete."
msgstr ""
"Koliko zajemov ostane v mapi dlaa_selftest ob DLL: starejši (mapa + zip) se izbrišejo, ko nastane "
"nov. vsi = nikoli ne briši."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Jezik tega menija. auto = jezik igre (privzeto); Levo / Desno izbere drugega. Linux / Proton: "
"kitajščina, japonščina in korejščina potrebujejo nameščene pisave, glej README. Datoteka "
"lang\\<code>.po ob DLL ima prednost, za vaše lastne popravke. Shrani jo obdrži. Brez cene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Vse bližnjice tega menija, ena vrstica na dejanje, s tipko na tipkovnici in gumbom krmilnika. "
"Desno odpre seznam; dejanje izberite z Desno, nato pritisnite novo tipko ali gumb volana. Takoj "
"se shrani v dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Zapiše vse tukaj prikazano v dlaa.ini (nastavitve ter položaja plošče / polja fps, ko ste ju "
"premaknili), vse druge vrstice ohrani. Naredite to, ko vam je rezultat všeč, sicer so spremembe "
"ob naslednjem zagonu izgubljene. Način se shrani sam."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, preset, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, CPU, log "
"detail), live and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Vrne vsako nastavitev v tem meniju na stanje, v katerem pride mod (model, ostrenje, ostrina "
"tekstur, območje DLAA, gibanje, ogledala, prednastavitev, plošča, okno fps, turbo, foveated, "
"hitrost sličic, CPU, podrobnost dnevnika), sproti in v dlaa.ini, vaše bližnjice in vse druge "
"vrstice pa ohrani."

