#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%hs = capture now (the menu closes first). The zip (dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL) holds "
"system info, the mod's and the game's log, dlaa.ini, your picture and DLAA off; Full adds what "
"DLSS got and the A/B sets; rewind adds the moment before. Your user name and home folder are "
"removed. %ls"
msgstr ""
"%hs = zajemi zdaj (meni se najprej zapre). Zip (mapa dlaa_selftest ob DLL) vsebuje podatke o "
"sistemu, dnevnik moda in igre, dlaa.ini, vašo sliko in DLAA izk.; Polni doda, kar je dobil DLSS, "
"in komplete A/B; previjanje doda trenutek pred tipko. Vaše uporabniško ime in domača mapa sta "
"odstranjena. %ls"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The 5 keys that open and drive this menu: %hs opens / closes it (the value), %hs / %hs / %hs / "
"%hs move (Hotkey column). While the menu is open only these 5 are kept from the game. %hs: change "
"them on the Hotkeys page."
msgstr ""
"5 tipk, ki odpirajo in upravljajo ta meni: %hs meni odpira / zapira (vrednost), %hs / %hs / %hs / "
"%hs premikajo (stolpec Bližnjica). Ko je meni odprt, se igri odvzame samo teh 5. %hs: spremenite "
"jih na strani Bližnjice."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Closes the menu; the 5 menu keys go back to the game. %hs does the same from any row."
msgstr "Zapre meni; 5 tipk menija se vrne igri. %hs naredi isto iz katere koli vrstice."

